1
00:00:00,709 --> 00:00:01,918
Okay, just slowly

2
00:00:01,918 --> 00:00:05,755
increase the angle like this.

3
00:00:09,092 --> 00:00:10,135
Consistency pays off

4
00:00:10,136 --> 00:00:11,691
more than anything.

5
00:00:16,907 --> 00:00:18,146
I'm better.

6
00:00:21,159 --> 00:00:22,159
Ji-sung

7
00:00:22,939 --> 00:00:25,108
you're so awesome.

8
00:00:25,108 --> 00:00:27,235
That's sudden.

9
00:00:27,235 --> 00:00:30,739
Watching the way
you treat your patients...

10
00:00:31,345 --> 00:00:34,848
it made me
want to be like you.

11
00:00:36,411 --> 00:00:39,581
A rehab therapist.

12
00:00:39,622 --> 00:00:42,417
I want to help people too
like you do.

13
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:43,877
I think what I've been through

14
00:00:43,877 --> 00:00:47,922
could actually help others.

15
00:00:47,923 --> 00:00:49,674
Seung‑hyun...

16
00:00:51,009 --> 00:00:52,427
Sounds silly, right?

17
00:00:52,510 --> 00:00:54,929
A patient wanting to be
a therapist.

18
00:00:54,929 --> 00:00:57,599
Honestly, I think you'd be
one of the best.

19
00:00:57,599 --> 00:00:58,600
It's not silly at all!

20
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:00,226
Welcome aboard.

21
00:01:00,772 --> 00:01:02,107
You really mean it?

22
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:04,939
Of course.

23
00:01:04,939 --> 00:01:09,360
Then... will you teach me?

24
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:12,989
I'll be the best teacher
you could ask for.
